# A new preset's dialog going in steps in the middle of a wide window (sf presenters.mbt panel_go): 添加目录, then
# 浏览文件夹…, then back by Escape, twice, then once more. MBUI_FIXTURE=newchat-preset-new, MBUI_WIN=1280x800,
# MBUI_FILM_PLATFORM=0.
timeout 20000
until 名字
wait 800
tap 添加目录
wait 900
tap 浏览文件夹…
wait 900
key esc
wait 900
key esc
wait 900
key esc
wait 900
exit
